      "message": "Depending upon which of A or C is defined as base class of the driver, the interface_version specified in the corresponding base class will be considered. \nFor eg. if Driver D\u0027s base class is C, then the interface_version of C will be considered; else if Driver D\u0027s base class is A, then the interface_version of A will be considered.",
